 "description_en_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>Service Parts Logistics and Procurement (7GD)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loiod513b77bb4494b1abe77d172ed3050d0\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiod513b77bb4494b1abe77d172ed3050d0__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Overview</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">In the service context, spare parts are replacement components that are kept in inventory and used to repair or maintain machinery, equipment, or other products. These parts ensure that any malfunctioning or worn-out elements can be replaced, minimizing downtime and maintaining operational efficiency.</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">To ensure seamless execution of a service timely procurement, storage and delivery of service parts can be crucial. This scope items provides capabilities to manage the logistics of service parts and their procurement as part of the service process.</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiod513b77bb4494b1abe77d172ed3050d0__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Key Process Flow</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\" id=\"loiod513b77bb4494b1abe77d172ed3050d0__ul_j2p_5gs_pbc\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Add service parts to a service order.</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Check availability of service parts.</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Reservation of service parts with or without manual goods issue.</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Advance shipment of service parts with reservation.</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Purchasing of service parts.</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Purchasing of service parts with advance shipment.</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Stock transfer of service parts.</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Goods issue posting on service part consumption.</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Cost posting and consideration in service billing and invoicing.</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiod513b77bb4494b1abe77d172ed3050d0__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Business Benefits</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\" id=\"loiod513b77bb4494b1abe77d172ed3050d0__ul_tph_dhs_pbc\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Embedded service part logistics in the service management process.</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Ensure availability of service parts for service execution.</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Automatic cost posting.</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Integration into billing and invoicing process.</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "description_zh_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>服务备件物流和采购 (7GD)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loiod513b77bb4494b1abe77d172ed3050d0\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiod513b77bb4494b1abe77d172ed3050d0__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">概览</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">在服务环境中，备件是保存在库存中并用于维修或维护机械、设备或其他产品的替换组件。这些部件确保可以替换任何故障或损坏元素，从而最大限度地减少停机时间并保持运营效率。</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">为确保服务的无缝执行，及时采购、存储和交付服务部件至关重要。此范围项目提供作为服务流程的一部分，管理服务部件及其采购物流的功能。</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiod513b77bb4494b1abe77d172ed3050d0__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">关键流程流</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\" id=\"loiod513b77bb4494b1abe77d172ed3050d0__ul_j2p_5gs_pbc\">\n       <li class=\"li\">将服务部件添加到服务订单。</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">检查服务备件的可用性。</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">预留含或不含手动发货的服务部件。</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">提前装运含预留的服务部件。</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">采购备件。</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">通过提前装运采购服务备件。</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">服务备件的库存转储。</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">备件消耗的发货过账。</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">服务开票和开发票中的成本过账和注意事项。</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiod513b77bb4494b1abe77d172ed3050d0__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">业务优势</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\" id=\"loiod513b77bb4494b1abe77d172ed3050d0__ul_tph_dhs_pbc\">\n       <li class=\"li\">服务管理流程中的嵌入式备件物流。</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">确保服务备件可用于服务执行。</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">自动成本过账。</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">集成到开票和开发票流程。</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
